to build scenes/blockouts, do boring stuff like UVs and export standard formats(.glb/gltf/obj/gbx/usd etc.)&lt;p&gt;Try it: &lt;a href="https://mixar.app" rel="nofollow"&gt;https://mixar.app&lt;/a&gt; - first week is free. Would love to get your feedback.&lt;/p&gt;
